# The screen's headless run (screen-headless.sh) against screen-core.py (full, hibernated):
# every page, the menu's operations, cancel, the hibernation question, the power key.
await home
shot home
tap Deployments
await deployments
shot deployments
tap 20261101-0702
await deployment
shot deployment
tap Start this one next
await confirm-select
shot confirm-select
tap Cancel
await cancelled
shot cancelled
tap Back to the start
await home
tap Deployments
await deployments
tap 20261101-0702
await deployment
tap Start this one next
await confirm-select
tap Start
await done
shot done
tap Back to the start
await home
shot home-candidate
tap Deployments
await deployments
tap Roll back
await confirm-rollback
shot confirm-rollback
tap Roll back
await hibernated
shot hibernated
tap Discard
await confirm-rollback
shot confirm-rollback-discard
tap Roll back
await done
tap Back to the start
await home
tap Deployments
await deployments
tap 20261112-0930
await deployment
tap Delete
await confirm-remove
shot confirm-remove
tap Delete
await failed
shot failed
tap Back to the start
await home
tap Reset
await reset
shot reset
tap Reset system
await confirm-reset
shot confirm-reset
tap Cancel
await cancelled
tap Back to the start
await home
tap Reset
await reset
tap Full reset
await confirm-reset-full
shot confirm-reset-full
tap Full reset
await done
shot done-reset
tap Back to the start
await home
tap Diagnostics
await diag
shot diag
tap Back to the start
await home
tap Restart
await restart
shot restart
tap Normal start
await confirm-restart
shot confirm-restart
tap Cancel
await home
# the power key alone: two presses move to Diagnostics, a hold chooses it
short
short
shot home-focus
long
await diag
tap Back to the start
await home
quit
